WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — rce-jepa (15s) Narrator Jyothi

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.363
First, instead of guessing raw code word by word,

2
00:00:03.363 --> 00:00:07.060
small models predict compact summaries of program meaning.

3
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:11.084
Second, any AI model may propose a candidate program,

4
00:00:11.084 --> 00:00:14.333
but a fast, strict checker decides what passes.

5
00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:19.730
Third, checking uses seventeen hundred times less energy than generating,

6
00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.352
and saved fixes slash big model calls.
